 ive. Tommy is one of the stars and creators of the new Netflix comedy serie
 s\,  Minimum Wage . After spending a year traveling the world performing s
 tand-up on a prestigious Watson Fellowship\, Tommy returned stateside to jo
 in the cast of  American High Shorts  and  College Life \, where he writ
 es\, stars in\, and produces viral comedy sketches that have racked up mill
 ions of views across social media. His on-screen credits include Hulu’s P
 izza Movie\, Summer of 69 and the Never Change! and the hit web series Min
 imum Wage. He always carries a harmonica. Instagram   Tik Tok \,  YouTube
